            "review_title": "Review at SON beef steak",
            "review_text": "kartor\nToronto214 contributions\n1\nDo it yourself barbecue; good value for money\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nIn Toronto this restaurant would be considered a Korean Barbecue. You choose a package which provides a variety of marinaded meats and some raw eggplant and corn that you barbecue on a gas cum coal barbecue embedded in the centre of your table. The package also provides for Kimchi, washed lettuce, a tasty meat salad, some dipping sauces and a plate of french fries. They are extremely generous with their portions and the cheapest package at 115VND Per person provided over 6 cuts of beef and pork. The restaurant has 8 tables and is well ventilated to ensure there is no lingering smoke from the barbecues. \nThe meal was a welcome break from the Vietnamese food we have been eating for the past week. The staff are friendly and very helpful.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 17, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
